# docs/CNAME is now TRACKED on purpose. thevfxsupervisor.com was cut over to GitHub Pages on
# 2026-08-06 and build.py emits it (CUTOVER_DONE=True). It must STAY committed: if it disappears
# from docs/, Pages drops the custom domain on the next build.

# Python build cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# docs/CNAME must NOT be committed: it makes the legacy Pages build fail instantly.
# The custom domain is configured via the Pages API instead (cname=thevfxsupervisor.com).
docs/CNAME
